{"hw":"ἀπαλλαξείω","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">ἀπαλλαξείω</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἀπαλλ-αξείω</span>, Desiderat. of <span class=\"gk\">ἀπαλλάσσομαι,</span> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">wish to be delivered from</b> or <b class=\"lex-tr\">get rid of,</b> <span class=\"gk\">τινός</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Th.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.95</span> </span>,<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.84</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Procop.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Arc.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4</span> </span>.</div></div>"}